The AshlarOS installer opens automatically in a window. If you closed it,
run ashlaros-install to start it again.

Press Super+Return to open a new terminal, Super+d for the application
menu, or Super+b for Firefox.
For Wi-Fi, authenticate to the wireless network using the iwctl utility.
For mobile broadband (WWAN) modems, connect with the mmcli utility.
Ethernet, WLAN and WWAN interfaces using DHCP should work automatically.

The install log is at /var/log/ashlaros-install.log.
